== build (linux/amd64)
== Google's endorsements of the approved launches, verified to the pinned GCE TCB root
   snp ccdc5cf01ba25526...: endorsed by Google
   snp 7a89cceaaba0bbdd...: not endorsed: Google publishes no endorsement for this measurement
   tdx c1ee9c16e3afc506...: endorsed by Google
